{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/AETHUS_Logo.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A story-driven sci-fi survival-crafting game about mining, base-building, and carving out a future in the ruins of corporate greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ExplorationGifFrame.gif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About AETHUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Maeve</strong> - ex-mining engineer for the <i><strong>Astral Research Corporation</strong></i> (<strong>ARC</strong>), a galactic megacorp that profits by draining entire planets of their resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She\u2019s left the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARC has not left her, however.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Aethus, ARC claims there is nothing worth having. <strong>Maeve knows they are wrong.</strong> With nothing but her basic mining equipment, tales from her beloved grandpa and her sarcastic AI drone companion,\u00a0<strong>Roland</strong>, she works to build a stable life outside of ARC\u2019s control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel a <strong>dystopian capitalist conspiracy</strong> as you delve through the remnants of <strong>a doomed expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong>.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/b4_constructyourminingcolony.png?t=1753095762\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/BuildingGifNewWithPanShot.gif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build and automate your surface mining outpost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the\u00a0<strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own perfectly optimised  base. <strong>Grow plants, raise fish or prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/a1.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/b2_mineforriches.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/MiningGifNewNewNew.gif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laser-blast mining in a handcrafted, physics-based alien world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend underground and use lasers, explosives, drills and more to gather <strong>hundreds of types of resources</strong> from your mining claim then <strong>refine them</strong> and <strong>craft new tools</strong> for exploration.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/a2.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/51e84226174dc3c48328f3ca36a0a8a6.avif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/lavacaves.gif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fully voiced narrative about family, resistance and choosing your own future</strong> <br>Built from the ground-up with story at its heart, uncover a dystopian corporate conspiracy and decide how far you\u2019re willing to go for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story is not an afterthought in AETHUS, there's always narrative to drive you forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/a3.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/b4_asoloindieendeavour.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Made with care, not crunch\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No AI content.</strong> No microtransactions. Just one person, one vision, one chance to leave your mark on <i>AETHUS</i>.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/PawsmonautLogoWhite.png?t=1753095762\" /></div><i>Pawsmonaut Games is a proud Scottish solo-independent game development studio, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>founded in 2023 to create deep, compelling experiences without micro-transactions, battle </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>passes or predatory monetisation.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2541530?t=1753095762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2541530?t=1753095762","capsule_image":