 she works to build a stable life outside of ARC\u2019s control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel a <strong>dystopian capitalist conspiracy</strong> as you delve through the remnants of <strong>a doomed expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong>.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/b4_constructyourminingcolony.png?t=1753095762\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/BuildingGifNewWithPanShot.gif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build and automate your surface mining outpost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the\u00a0<strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own perfectly optimised  base. <strong>Grow plants, raise fish or prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/a1.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/b2_mineforriches.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/MiningGifNewNewNew.gif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laser-blast mining in a handcrafted, physics-based alien world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend underground and use lasers, explosives, drills and more to gather <strong>hundreds of types of resources</strong> from your mining claim then <strong>refine them</strong> and <strong>craft new tools</strong> for exploration.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/a2.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/51e84226174dc3c48328f3ca36a0a8a6.avif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/lavacaves.gif?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fully voiced narrative about family, resistance and choosing your own future</strong> <br>Built from the ground-up with story at its heart, uncover a dystopian corporate conspiracy and decide how far you\u2019re willing to go for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story is not an afterthought in AETHUS, there's always narrative to drive you forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/a3.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/b4_asoloindieendeavour.png?t=1753095762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Made with care, not crunch\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No AI content.</strong> No microtransactions. Just one person, one vision, one chance to leave your mark on <i>AETHUS</i>.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/PawsmonautLogoWhite.png?t=1753095762\" /></div><i>Pawsmonaut Games is a proud Scottish solo-independent game development studio, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>founded in 2023 to create deep, compelling experiences without micro-transactions, battle </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>passes or predatory monetisation.</i></p>","developers":["Pawsmonaut Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/d999d20a9e47e722be6d2085c741e14d1554f27b/header.jpg?t=1753095762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257050297,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050297/movie480.mp4?t=1724860929","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050297/movie_max.mp4?t=1724860929"},"name":"AETHUS - Official Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257050297/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1724860929","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050297/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1724860929","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050297/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1724860929"}}],"name":"AETHUS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBC<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBC<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Pawsmonaut Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":