store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/ss_195fc934589ed378e07f6f86dd4bb45bd65a5e6b.600x338.jpg?t=1753095762"}],"short_description":"Explore a futuristic sci-fi underground world, mine resources, and build a fully customisable Outpost. Uncover a dystopian corporate conspiracy in this story-driven survival and base-building game with a distinctive low-poly style.","steam_appid":2541530,"support_info":{"email":"hello@pawsmonaut.games","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}